    "body": "Thanks for pointing out these functions. I hadn't found them previously though I did do a quick search. On review though, I think this might not be the best idea. It looks like `isLowerAsciiLetter()` and `isUpperAsciiLetter()` would only work for latin characters A through Z and would not work as intended for non-latin letters and letters with accents or diacritics. The utility functions I provided should work for all unicode lowercase and uppercase characters.",
